    <string-array name="feeding_night_watch_praise">
        <item>Nobody saw it. It still counted.</item>
        <item>The moon kept you company, at least.</item>
        <item>Whoever was awake: that was the hard part, and you did it.</item>
        <item>Someone will sleep through the night eventually. Probably.</item>
        <item>Two of you, one small tyrant, and the kettle. A fair fight.</item>
    </string-array>
