    <string-array name="pumping_stash_praise">
        <item>Made out of nothing but you. Quietly astonishing.</item>
        <item>Every drop of that was an hour you gave up.</item>
        <item>Nobody claps for this one. They should.</item>
        <item>The freezer is filling up because you sat there.</item>
        <item>Liquid gold, and you made all of it.</item>
    </string-array>
